리상담 프로그램 시행(온라인 오프라인), 중소기업 복지플랫폼 지원\n• 리프레쉬 : 장기근속포상휴가 및 해외여행 항공비지원", "preferred_points": "React 개발 경험\n• 클라이어트/서버에 대한 이해\n• IT관련 기사자격증 우대(정보통신기사, 정보처리기사등)\n• 관련학과 전공자 우대"}, "due_time": null, "score": null, "company_images": [{"url": "https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10105/k5yj8psooa9iqfz6__1080_790.jpg", "id": 117096}, {"url": "https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10105/xzcqhg6z8de6ezjy__1080_790.jpg", "id": 117095}, {"url": "https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10105/1tjwdiulioqwxem0__1080_790.jpg", "id": 117093}, {"url": "https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10105/ynfsjwylvs3eseyz__1080_790.jpg", "id": 117097}, {"url": "https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10105/0f9ui8m43pigyao1__1080_790.jpg", "id": 117090}, {"url": "https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10105/9ks6qezle4zfgser__1080_790.jpg", "id": 117089}, {"url": "https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10105/hy7o04aik7cxagki__1080_790.jpg", "id": 117088}, {"url": "https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10105/njy1rhkn4vkllkpd__1080_790.jpg", "id": 117092}, {"url": "https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10105/kyb0udhajqttjhyd__1080_790.jpg", "id": 117094}, {"url": "https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10105/ikgrvkebct5zftgx__1080_790.jpg", "id": 33369}, {"url": "https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/company/10105/lduusxpnf6qwmup7__1080_790.jpg", "id": 33370}], "hidden": false, "skill_tags": [], "status": "active", "is_bookmark": false, "company": {"id": 10105, "industry_name": "IT, 컨텐츠", "application_response_stats": {"avg_rate": 0.0, "level": "very_low", "delayed_count": 0, "avg_day": null, "remained_count": 0, "type": "applied_reply_done"}, "name": "이즈피엠피"}, "has_analysis": false, "is_company_follow": false, "compare_country": true, "logo_img": {"origin": "https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/wdes/0_4.f18afd1b.jpg", "thumb": "https://static.wanted.co.kr/images/wdes/0_5.f18afd1b.jpg"}, "address": {"country": "한국", "full_location": "서울 서초구 남부순환로 2465, (서초동, 혜